at 0 capture out
at 30 capture in
at 32 capture out
at 70 capture in
at 72 capture out
at 220 capture in
at 222 capture out
at 600 capture in
at 602 capture out
at 1100 capture in
at 1102 capture out
# Ninjix authored demo timeline.
# Times can be written as seconds; the runtime converts them to 60 Hz ticks.
# `move dx dy during t` emits smooth relative PS/2 mouse packets.

at 0.2s caption top 3s NINJIX LEVEL 1
at 0.8s key ENTER down
at 0.9s key ENTER up

at 1.5s caption 3s PLACE A BASIC TOWER NEAR THE FIRST TURN
at 1.8s key 1 down
at 1.9s key 1 up
at 2.0s move -192 220 during 1.2s
at 3.4s mouse 0 0 1
at 3.5s mouse 0 0 0

at 4.5s caption 3s ADD SLOWING SUPPORT FOR THE LONG LANE
at 4.8s key 3 down
at 4.9s key 3 up
at 5.0s move 128 -96 during 1.1s
at 6.3s mouse 0 0 1
at 6.4s mouse 0 0 0

at 7.4s caption 3s START THE FIRST WAVE
at 7.6s move 314 -390 during 1.8s
at 9.6s mouse 0 0 1
at 9.7s mouse 0 0 0

at 12s caption 4s LET THE TOWERS WORK
at 18s mouse 0 0 1
at 18.1s mouse 0 0 0


at 20s key ESC down
at 20.1s key ESC up
at 20.3s key DOWN down
at 20.4s key DOWN up
at 20.6s key ENTER down
at 20.7s key ENTER up
at 21s key ESC down
at 21.1s key ESC up
